1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,420
May your cup be full of something good, whatever suits you best

2
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:08,340
May your days be full of new things and your nights be full of rest

3
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:12,260
May your smile be wide and crooked and your laughter shake the hall

4
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:16,420
May the good-hearted find your table, and may there be room for them all

5
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:21,700
May the ones you've lost sit with you in the stories that you tell

6
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:26,660
And may every day you're given be another day lived well

7
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:30,980
Raise whatever suits you, be it whiskey, be it water

8
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:35,140
Here's to all the ones we're missing, every son and every daughter

9
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:38,500
Oh, they're never gone while we're reminiscing

10
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,420
There's a seat for 'em at the table

11
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:46,420
So we'll sing for 'em together for as long as we are able

12
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:47,320
Oh, they're never gone while we're reminiscing
